	)
	(text "JMISC (UNO Q misc header)\n45 GPIO_86 -> LCD_RESET (1.8 V)\n47 GPIO_82 -> LCD_TE (1.8 V)\n49 GPIO_18 / PWM[0] -> BL_PWM (5-100 kHz)\n54/56 +5V -> backlight boost\n57 VCC_PX3_1P8 -> panel IOVCC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "35243adc-c3a3-4f3e-90e1-7e8d80c823d9")
	)
	(text "UNO Q carrier - MIPI-DSI display (ET040CR10-T, NV3051F, 4-lane)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5e2278c8-4d64-4a34-b500-7bf5ea6cab46")
	)
	(text "Generated from the routed PCB so that 'Update PCB from Schematic' is a no-op.\nNet names match the board and its .kicad_dru rules (DSI_* = 100 ohm pairs on JLC04161H-7628)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9e59fed6-125f-44fd-be98-2ff093cf5cf4")
	)
	(text "Backlight: TPS61165 boost, 5S4P white LEDs, Vf 13.5-16 V\nI_LED = 0.2 V / R1 = 161 mA (datasheet If = 160 mA)\nCTRL: PWM 5-100 kHz (internal ~800k pull-down = off at reset)\nL1: 10 uH, Isat >= 1.2 A, DCR <= 0.25 ohm   D1: 40 V Schottky   C2 >= 50 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b8fd4127-4388-490e-a639-7167689d9d9f")
	)
	(text "JMEDIA (UNO Q media header, ASX00083 sheet 2)\nDSI lanes 1:1, no lane/polarity swaps.\nPWR_3P3V (58/60) feeds panel VCI.\n!! Pin-1 orientation on the PCB is inferred - verify vs UNO Q pinout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd856aec-4583-45c7-a91d-f6b0b085be68")
	)
	(text "J1: Hirose FH12-40S-0.5SH(55), 0.5 mm pitch\nbottom side, FPC entry at the top board edge\nPinout: ET040CR10-T datasheet sec. 5\n(panel pin N -> J1 pin N)\n!! Confirm FPC contact side vs FH12 so that\npanel pin 1 lands on J1 pin 1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d7a4b641-3b5d-4488-99ba-2d5bb9902123")
